<title>UK: Greene King first half profits up 38 percent.</title>
<headline>Greene King first half profits up 38 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>24 weeks ended October 20</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		18.8		   vs 17.9</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 4.75		   vs 4.23</p>
<p> Pretax		     13.4		   vs 11.1</p>
<p> Turnover		   78.6		   vs 76.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Greene King incurred integration costs of 2.0 million stg after the acquisition of Magic Pub.</p>
<p>Full company name - Greene King Plc.</p>
</text>
